", "stage": "ask_dose", "t": 13.603}, {"type": "agent_speaking", "ts": 1794319129.980837, "call_id": "c019_P4_f1_c384", "patient_id": "P4", "text": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ, ನಾನು ಖುರಾಕ್, ಲಕ್ಷ್ಮಮ್ಮ ಅವರ ಆರೋಗ್ಯ ಕೇಂದ್ರದಿಂದ ಮಾತನಾಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದೇನೆ. ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಿದರೂ ಅವರೊಂದಿಗೆ ಮಾತನಾಡಲು ಆಗಲಿಲ್ಲ. ಅವರು ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿದ್ದಾರಾ, ಮಾತ್ರೆ ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾರಾ?", "english": "Hello, this is Khurak from ಲಕ್ಷ್ಮಮ್ಮ's health centre. We couldn't reach them after two tries. Are they okay and taking their medicine?", "audio": "/audio/rec/c019_P4_f1_c384_a0.wav", "stage": "family_check", "t": 13.884}, {"type": "transcribed", "ts": 1794319130.4391482, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "stage": "ask_dose", "text": "हाँ, ले ली। आँखें पीली नहीं हैं, सब ठीक है।", "stt_ms": 738, "mock": false, "audio": "/audio/clips/clip_d1561e082421cfdb.wav", "t": 14.343}, {"type": "understood", "ts": 1794319130.4481697, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "stage": "ask_dose", "dose": "TAKEN", "red_flags": [], "negated": ["yellow_eyes"], "benign": [], "watch": [], "confidence": 0.92, "evidence": ["affirm=हां", "dose_taken=ले ली", "red:yellow_eyes=आंखें पीली (neg)", "deny=नहीं (ignored: not leading)", "no_problem=सब ठीक है"], "evon": null, "step_rule": "R2", "t": 14.352}, {"type": "agent_speaking", "ts": 1794319130.4531708, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "text": "बस पक्का करने के लिए, क्या आपको आँखों या त्वचा में पीलापन है? हाँ या नहीं बोलिए।", "english": "Just to confirm, do you have yellow eyes or skin? Please say yes or no.", "audio": "/audio/rec/c019_P5_p1_97e9_a1.wav", "stage": "confirm_symptom", "rule": "R2", "t": 14.357}, {"type": "listening_done", "ts": 1794319131.0266917, "call_id": "c019_P6_p1_bf15", "patient_id": "P6", "stage": "ask_dose", "t": 14.93}, {"type": "transcribed", "ts": 1794319131.6670895, "call_id": "c019_P6_p1_bf15", "patient_id": "P6", "stage": "ask_dose", "text": "हाँ, दवा ले ली है।", "stt_ms": 637, "mock": false, "audio": "/audio/clips/clip_ba4613809509f4f9.wav", "t": 15.57}, {"type": "understood", "ts": 1794319131.6723247, "call_id": "c019_P6_p1_bf15", "patient_id": "P6", "stage": "ask_dose", "dose": "TAKEN", "red_flags": [], "negated": [], "benign": [], "watch": [], "confidence": 0.92, "evidence": ["affirm=हां", "dose_taken=ले ली है"], "evon": null, "step_rule": null, "t": 15.576}, {"type": "agent_speaking", "ts": 1794319131.6758435, "call_id": "c019_P6_p1_bf15", "patient_id": "P6", "text": "क्या कोई तकलीफ़ है? जैसे उल्टी, पेट दर्द, या आँखों में पीलापन?", "english": "Any problems? Like vomiting, stomach pain, or yellowness in the eyes?", "audio": "/audio/rec/c019_P6_p1_bf15_a1.wav", "stage": "ask_symptoms", "rule": null, "t": 15.579}, {"type": "listening_done", "ts": 1794319132.0230575, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "stage": "confirm_symptom", "t": 15.926}, {"type": "transcribed", "ts": 1794319132.683589, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "stage": "confirm_symptom", "text": "नहीं, पीलापन नहीं है।", "stt_ms": 658, "mock": false, "audio": "/audio/clips/clip_45794172fc4ee16d.wav", "t": 16.587}, {"type": "understood", "ts": 1794319132.6876361, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "stage": "confirm_symptom", "dose": "UNCLEAR", "red_flags": [], "negated": ["yellow_eyes"], "benign": [], "watch": [], "confidence": 0.85, "evidence": ["deny=नहीं", "red:yellow_eyes=पीलापन (neg)", "deny=नहीं (ignored: not leading)"], "evon": null, "step_rule": null, "t": 16.591}, {"type": "decided", "ts": 1794319132.6946566, "call_id": "c019_P5_p1_97e9", "patient_id": "P5", "name": "Raju Yadav", "status": "GREEN", "rule": "R8", "rule_text": "Dose taken, no problems -> thank + log", "reasons": ["dose_taken"], "actions": ["play_template(thanks, hi-IN)"], "closing_text": "बहुत अच्छे! धन्यवाद, कल फिर इसी समय बात करेंगे।", "closing_english": "Very good! Thank you, we'll talk again tomorrow at the same time.", "audio": "/audio/rec/c019_P5_p1_97e9_close.wav", "kind": "patient", "t": 16.598}, {"type": "lis